export const defaults=[['start','','0','S','carry'],['start','0','0','R','seek'],['start','1','1','R','seek'],['seek','0','0','R','seek'],['seek','1','1','R','seek'],['seek','','','L','carry'],['carry','0','1','S','start'],['carry','1','0','L','carry'],['carry','','1','S','start']];
export class Machine{constructor(){this.tape=new Map();this.head=0;this.state='start';this.steps=0;this.history=[];}read(){return this.tape.get(this.head)||'';}step(rules){const a=rules.filter(r=>r[0]===this.state&&r[1]===this.read());if(a.length!==1)return false;const r=a[0];this.history.push({head:this.head,state:this.state,old:this.read()});if(r[2])this.tape.set(this.head,r[2]);else this.tape.delete(this.head);this.head+=r[3]==='R'?1:r[3]==='L'?-1:0;this.state=r[4];this.steps++;return true;}back(){let p=this.history.pop();if(!p)return;this.head=p.head;this.state=p.state;if(p.old)this.tape.set(p.head,p.old);else this.tape.delete(p.head);this.steps--;}}
export function validate(rs){let seen=new Set();for(let i=0;i<rs.length;i++){let r=rs[i];if(r.length!==5||!r[0].trim()||!r[4].trim()||!['L','R','S'].includes(r[3])||[...r[1]].length>1||[...r[2]].length>1)return `行 ${i+1}：状態名・1文字以内の記号・移動 L/R/S を指定してください。`;let k=JSON.stringify(r.slice(0,2));if(seen.has(k))return `行 ${i+1}：状態と読み取り記号が重複しています。`;seen.add(k);}return '';}
export function csv(rs){return '\uFEFFstate,read,write,move,next\r\n'+rs.map(r=>r.map(v=>'"'+v.replaceAll('"','""')+'"').join(',')).join('\r\n');}
export function parseCSV(t){t=t.replace(/^\uFEFF/,'');let rs=[],r=[],v='',q=false;for(let i=0;i<t.length;i++){let c=t[i];if(c==='"'){if(q&&t[i+1]==='"'){v+='"';i++;}else q=!q;}else if(c===','&&!q){r.push(v);v='';}else if((c==='\n'||c==='\r')&&!q){if(c==='\r'&&t[i+1]==='\n')i++;r.push(v);if(r.some(x=>x!==''))rs.push(r);r=[];v='';}else v+=c;}if(q)throw Error('CSV の引用符が閉じていません。');r.push(v);if(r.some(x=>x!==''))rs.push(r);if(rs[0]?.[0]==='state')rs.shift();return rs;}
